{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Sets PLAN_AUTONOMY for the kanban's plan-autonomy switch. Takes a required Boolean enabled; delegates to agent.model.set_setting, which updates the live agent runtime and persists runtime/agent/botd.properties, then verifies the live value. Enabling also starts/restarts agent.plan.worker_start; disabling prevents NEW plan steps but deliberately lets an already-running step finish. Returns JSONObject {status, plan_autonomy, msg}; a worker-start failure is reported honestly with plan_autonomy=true because the setting was already saved. Admin-only, like the other mutating plan commands. Inputs: - `enabled` (*boolean*): true enables autonomy and starts the worker; false disables new autonomous steps.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;","params":[{"name":"enabled","type":"Boolean"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"wulhwh1a1706f7abap180","readers":[],"time":1792887821799,"username":"system","writers":[]}